.TH "FINANCE REPORT"
The finance report prints miscellaneous information about the finances
of each tycoon in the game
including cash on hand, stock value, net worth, last dividend,
and number of buy transactions to date.
.s3
The general form of the command and a sample report:
.s3
.NF
[21h] ::: finance
       ~~~~~ Fast Food Finance Report ~~~~~
\&.................Tycoon   Cash    Stock    Net Worth  Last Div
                Scrooge  $6500    $3500     $10000    $320
                   GNAT  $7000    $2500     $9500     $190
                   J.R.  $6000    $3250     $9250     $305
              Top Brass  $6000    $3050     $9050     $255
                  Getty  $5500    $3100     $8600     $290
       Charlie McCarthy  $5000    $1000     $6000     $100
      Winston Churchill  $5000    $500      $5500     $50
.FI
.s3
The "Last Div" column displays the amount of dividend (and interest) income
at the most recent update.
.s3
